0001   0000             ; Encoding rules that no shipped table selects (spec 07-encoding-rules.md 7.25).
0002   0000             ; Assemble with -51: tasm51 declares .NOARGSHIFT and is LSFIRST, so an injected
0003   0000             ; row behaves exactly as it would in its intended table. Each rule is added with
0004   0000             ; .ADDINSTR and then exercised; the expected emission is in the comment.
0005   0000             ;
0006   0000             ; Verified byte-for-byte against the 2001 release binary (tasm.exe under wine).
0007   0000             ; Documented in the notes and the manual 7.25.
0008   0000                     .org 0
